-- Procedural build plans for every character. Pure data (no Roblox types) so the
-- standalone Luau CLI can load it for preview rendering (tools/export_designs.luau).
--
-- Each entry is an ordered list of parts; the FIRST part is the model root (PrimaryPart).
-- Part fields:
--   s = size {x, y, z} in studs        p = position {x, y, z} relative to root
--   c = color {r, g, b} (defaults to the character's base color)
--   b = true -> Ball shape             m = material name ("Neon", "Metal", ...)
--   t = transparency
-- Convention: -Z is the front (faces of the characters), +Y is up.
-- Design rule: every character must telegraph BOTH halves of its name --
-- the food shape AND the animal/persona features.

local BLACK = { 15, 15, 15 }
local WHITE = { 240, 240, 240 }

local Designs = {}

